Consider the following Python code snippet.

```python
def f(a,b):
    if (a==0):
        return b
    if (a%2==1):
        return 2*f((a-1)/2,b)
    return b+f(a-1,b)
print(f(15,10))
```

The value printed by the code snippet is __________ (Answer in integer)

Consider the following pseudocode.

```text
Create empty stack S
Set x=0, flag=0, sum=0
Push x onto S
while (S is not empty){
    if (flag equals 0){
        Set x = x+1
        Push x onto S}
    if (x equals 8):
        Set flag=1
    if (flag equals 1){
        x = Pop(S)
        if (x is odd):
            Pop(S)
        Set sum = sum + x}
}
Output sum
```

The value of `sum` output by a program executing the above pseudocode is __________ (Answer in integer)
